<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n61043" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῡρι-ακός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύριος</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or <i>for an
			owner</i> or <i>master,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Stud.Pal.
				22.177.18
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>; but usu. <i>of the Roman Emperor</i>,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ κ. φίσκος</span>
			<i>the fiscus</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>CIG</u>
				2827
			</span></i> (Aphrod.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Supp.Epigr.</u>
				2.567
			</span></i> (Caria (?)); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. ψῆφοι,
			λόγος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				669.13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				18
			</span></i> (Egypt, <span class="entity">i A.D.</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. χρῆμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>POxy.</u>
					474.41
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> esp. <i>belonging to the Lord (Christ</i>): K. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεῖπνον</span>
			<i>the Lord's Supper</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>1 Ep.Cor.</u>
				11.20
			</span></i>; ἡ K. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡμέρα</span>”
				<i>the Lord's day,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Apoc.
					1.10
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ Κυριακόν</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δῶμα</span>) <i>the Lord's house</i>,
				Edict.Maximiniap.<i><span class="en">
				Eus.
				<u>PE</u>
				9.10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			Subst.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κυριακός, ὁ</span>, spirit invoked in magic, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PMag.Par.</u>
				1.916
			</span></i>.</div>
